ce_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The server works out the discount against the order as it stands under the transaction lock, so an item added meanwhile moves the discount, not the total; it is computed from the undiscounted check so a second rounding replaces the first, and it cannot go below the cover and other charges because a discount only comes off the food."}, {"id": "docs_api_discount_after_check_changes", "label": "Discount after the check changes (percentage recomputed, euros kept)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/API.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A percentage is recomputed on the new food total, while a discount in euros (amount or total) stays what was agreed and never exceeds the food left on the check."}, {"id": "docs_api_discount_settings", "label": "Discount settings (/api/settings/discount, discount_methods)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/API.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "discount_methods lists the switched-on ways to discount (total, percentage, amount) in button order, never empty; the discount window opens on the first."}, {"id": "docs_api_manager_pin_override", "label": "Manager/owner PIN override", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/API.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_api_service_run_endpoint", "label": "PATCH /orders/:id/items/:itemId/service-run", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/API.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Runs are labels, not gates: kot_batch is deliberately untouched, so a row already printed still moves and nothing is re-sent."}, {"id": "docs_ap